  "update_count": 80,
  "description_snippet": "When SocketStream::Connect() is called, it defers most of the work to DoBeforeConnect(), which is called via a task posted to the MessageLoop. However, the UrlRequestContext object used by DoBeforeConnect() can be deleted (via destruction of ProfileIOData) in-between these two calls."
}